    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>A Weapon Accessory made only to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pistols\" title=\"Pistols\">Pistols</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rifles\" title=\"Rifles\">Rifles</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heavy_Weapons\" title=\"Heavy Weapons\">Heavy Weapons</a>, and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)\" title=\"Exotic Weapons (Ranged)\">Exotic Weapons (Ranged)</a> that deal Energy damage, the Beam Splitter Weapon Accessory makes it easier to fire a powerful energy bolt by increasing the size of the bolt fired. Once per encounter, the wielder of a weapon with a Beam Splitter that uses the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Blast\" title=\"Power Blast\">Power Blast</a> Feat to modify an attack roll deals 2 points of damage for every 1 point subtracted from the attack bonus. </p>",
